WEBVTT

01:30.480 --> 01:31.860
Bingo!

01:31.860 --> 01:33.030
The tomb spiral is starting.

01:33.030 --> 01:34.280
EPISODE 3: THE ONE WELL-SUITED TO DOMINATE
The tomb spiral is starting.

01:34.280 --> 01:36.080
EPISODE 3: THE ONE WELL-SUITED TO DOMINATE
A tomb is about to appear here.

01:36.080 --> 01:38.930
Nice. Just as the prophecy said.

01:42.080 --> 01:44.670
The spiral is about to begin now.

01:44.670 --> 01:50.130
I know that. But there's a prophecy that
the Korean who stole the axe relic is near you.

01:50.690 --> 01:56.300
Also, I don't know what it means, but you've
been warned to "be careful with alcohol."

01:58.290 --> 01:59.310
That guy!

01:59.900 --> 02:02.750
The one in the prophecy?!

02:44.320 --> 02:47.020
A menacing aura hangs in the air.

02:47.020 --> 02:49.170
Here comes a troublesome one.

02:51.060 --> 02:52.030
Are you okay?

02:52.030 --> 02:54.430
A tomb filled with broken katanas.

02:54.430 --> 02:57.280
It's definitely Muramasa's Katana tomb.

03:00.400 --> 03:05.000
Muramasa was the name of a swordsmith active
from the Sengoku period through the Edo period.

03:05.870 --> 03:09.380
It was known as the famous sword
"Muramasa" because of its sharpness.

03:11.260 --> 03:15.490
The grandfather, father,
and son of the family

03:15.490 --> 03:18.370
were all killed by that Muramasa in the end.

03:19.390 --> 03:23.540
The cursed Muramasa sword
that slaughtered an entire clan.

03:23.540 --> 03:27.140
This tomb was particularly
hostile toward humans.

03:27.140 --> 03:28.400
Oh...

03:28.400 --> 03:29.080
WARNING

03:29.080 --> 03:30.260
THE RELIC'S BLOODTHIRSTY AURA
IS PERMEATING YOUR BODY

03:30.260 --> 03:31.210
WARNING

03:31.210 --> 03:32.900
YOUR SKIN IS BEING DAMAGED,
YOU NEED PROTECTION

03:35.510 --> 03:38.410
It has begun.
Gotta clear this one quickly.

03:38.960 --> 03:40.450
Let's go, then.

03:40.450 --> 03:42.560
Wait for me, Muramasa.

03:51.460 --> 03:53.060
Sheesh...

03:53.580 --> 03:57.470
Damn it! Why is the tomb
so freaking huge?!

03:58.850 --> 04:02.210
No time to dawdle.
Pull yourself together.

04:04.770 --> 04:09.480
This place is too big, I can't even locate
the relic using the Golden Axe.

04:10.210 --> 04:13.650
The Japanese guy
should know where it is.

04:15.510 --> 04:19.839
If I’d known it'd turn out like this, I should've
stalked him and waited for the right moment.

04:19.839 --> 04:22.560
At this rate, the Muramasa will be dibsed.

04:22.560 --> 04:25.040
I gotta hurry and find him first.

04:25.040 --> 04:27.550
Where did that prick go?

04:27.550 --> 04:28.750
Wha...

04:30.660 --> 04:31.730
What happened?!

04:31.730 --> 04:33.040
Calm down!

04:33.040 --> 04:36.050
Papa, that person is weird!

04:38.180 --> 04:39.870
Stop it!

04:40.780 --> 04:42.550
That high school girl...

04:43.970 --> 04:46.260
She's been possessed by that relic.

04:46.260 --> 04:49.710
If someone is cut by that sword,
they’ll be possessed, too.

04:49.710 --> 04:51.310
- She's acting strange!
- If more people start swinging

04:51.310 --> 04:54.180
that sword around,
things will get out of hand.

04:58.530 --> 05:00.820
There it is.

05:01.520 --> 05:05.830
A mechanism where a bridge is built
when a sacrifice is offered into the hole.

05:06.990 --> 05:08.190
Hey!

05:08.190 --> 05:12.160
Was it a Japanese guy
who dropped you here and bailed?

05:12.160 --> 05:13.810
That's right!

05:13.810 --> 05:17.590
When that guy started singing a weird song
in Japanese, a hole suddenly appeared!

05:17.590 --> 05:21.340
Then he shoved us
down here and bailed!

05:21.860 --> 05:22.980
All right.

05:22.980 --> 05:26.820
If he was here just a moment ago,
then there's still a chance.

05:29.980 --> 05:33.230
Okay, time to borrow this one's power.

05:34.900 --> 05:36.320
What are you doing?!

05:40.290 --> 05:42.260
A rope-patterned bracelet.

05:43.010 --> 05:44.910
Inside this case is a mochi.

05:46.350 --> 05:49.410
The relic of the brother and sister
who became the sun and the moon.

05:49.860 --> 05:53.250
The rice cakes that a tiger
demanded from a mother

05:53.250 --> 05:55.900
on her way home from work...

05:58.080 --> 06:00.670
And the thick rope that
came down from the sky

06:00.670 --> 06:03.870
to save the brother and sister
who were about to be eaten by the tiger.

06:05.440 --> 06:06.430
Oh...

06:06.430 --> 06:07.950
TITLE THIEF'S HAND UNLOCKED
NEW SKILL OBTAINED

06:07.950 --> 06:09.430
TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS
NIMBLE FINGERS (RANK F) ACTIVATED

06:09.430 --> 06:12.940
A new skill, huh? Now I got all four.

06:12.940 --> 06:14.230
NIMBLE FINGERS (RANK F)

06:14.230 --> 06:15.330
BY SIMPLY TOUCHING AN ITEM ONCE,
THE USER IS ABLE TO LEARN HOW TO USE IT

06:15.330 --> 06:16.690
TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS (4/4)

06:16.690 --> 06:17.940
NIMBLE FINGERS (RANK F)
INCREASED DEXTERITY OF YOUR HANDS

06:19.940 --> 06:21.210
YOU HAVE SUCCESSFULLY AWAKENED
ALL THE FOUR HIDDEN TALENTS WITHIN,

06:21.210 --> 06:22.420
YOU HAVE NOW BECOME
A FULLY-FLEDGED TOMB RAIDER

06:22.420 --> 06:23.570
MISSION COMPLETE

06:23.570 --> 06:24.950
YOU WILL RECEIVE YOUR REWARD
AFTER EXTRACTING FROM THE TOMB

06:26.190 --> 06:27.950
Nice timing.

06:54.120 --> 06:54.810
Tie her!

06:54.810 --> 07:00.620
Ooh! Can I?!
Spin, spin, spin and tie!

07:07.390 --> 07:10.410
You know where that Japanese guy went to?

07:10.960 --> 07:15.410
Yeah, he crossed the bridge over
the hole and went into the cave.

07:15.940 --> 07:19.520
So it was the user of the prophetic relic
who told him, after all.

07:19.520 --> 07:20.940
Hey!

07:21.420 --> 07:24.420
Could you do something about this rope?

07:25.550 --> 07:29.430
Missy, come play with me!
Come on!

07:29.900 --> 07:32.190
These relics, I swear...

07:32.190 --> 07:33.470
Come back to me.

07:33.470 --> 07:38.380
Why?! No way! I wanna play more!

07:40.940 --> 07:44.940
I'll let you out, so help me
catch that Japanese guy.

07:45.700 --> 07:50.510
Since he's the scoundrel who set you guys up,
let's give him a taste of his own medicine.

07:57.390 --> 08:01.170
Yes, yes. The Future Guide
said it's around here, huh.

08:01.170 --> 08:02.960
Bingo.

08:14.160 --> 08:16.640
Let's take a look.

08:17.230 --> 08:20.730
Where's that cute relic bastard?

08:20.730 --> 08:24.260
I've taken care of all the witnesses,

08:24.260 --> 08:27.670
so as long as I get my hands on the Muramasa,
the mission will be complete.

08:27.670 --> 08:30.740
Also, that annoying Korean
who ripped me off...

08:31.360 --> 08:34.740
I've got to track down that son of a bitch
and take him out.

08:34.740 --> 08:40.000
If I get my hands on the Muramasa, no one,
I mean no one, will be a match for me.

08:41.409 --> 08:43.750
I'll win this!

08:48.300 --> 08:50.260
Shit! What the hell?!

08:50.750 --> 08:52.880
It's nothing but broken katanas!

08:52.880 --> 08:55.010
Where's the Muramasa?!

08:59.060 --> 09:00.520
There he is!

09:00.520 --> 09:02.420
- How did they get here?!
- It's him!

09:02.420 --> 09:03.410
That's the one!

09:03.410 --> 09:05.520
Hey, you! You're getting your ass kicked!

09:05.520 --> 09:07.780
How dare you!

09:09.180 --> 09:11.280
Hey, wait!

09:17.620 --> 09:20.080
Is this your doing?!

09:21.010 --> 09:25.630
Who else? To have come all this way
and not find a single relic...

09:25.630 --> 09:28.670
Well, I suppose this is the best
your army can do.

09:29.810 --> 09:31.380
Now...

09:31.380 --> 09:34.850
Find the relic, Golden Axe!

09:56.000 --> 09:58.640
You have finally found me!

09:59.170 --> 10:03.620
If you want to gain power,
let me drink the blood of ten people.

10:03.620 --> 10:08.420
If I drink human blood,
I can regain my true form.

10:09.120 --> 10:13.130
Otherwise,
I will lock you all up here forever.

10:13.620 --> 10:15.640
Whose voice is that?

10:16.190 --> 10:18.820
This is exactly why blade relics
are such a hassle.

10:18.820 --> 10:20.890
Is that what you call a trial?

10:20.890 --> 10:25.380
Correct! What are you doing?
Hurry and kill people!

10:25.380 --> 10:26.800
No, thank you.

10:28.000 --> 10:30.360
I'll show you the power of Dominance!

10:30.360 --> 10:32.570
W-Wait!

10:33.150 --> 10:34.910
Oww!

10:37.910 --> 10:41.450
You're the one being tested, not me!

10:41.450 --> 10:44.900
Suck in all your clones, Muramasa!

10:44.900 --> 10:49.420
A mere human like you!

11:26.210 --> 11:28.920
Slowly, carefully climb up.

11:33.010 --> 11:34.800
How do we climb up?

11:37.260 --> 11:40.380
Hey, you can't just line up.

11:41.660 --> 11:43.930
Please, let me out.

11:44.450 --> 11:46.390
I'll recommend you to our government.

11:46.390 --> 11:50.270
The annual salary is good, and we have
the prophetic relic, the Future Guide.

11:50.270 --> 11:52.300
Why not take this opportunity
to join our team?

11:52.300 --> 11:55.870
I thought the Future Guide is supposed
to be a relic that only its owner can use?

11:55.870 --> 11:58.450
There's a company that can solve that problem,

11:58.450 --> 12:01.200
and they won't hesitate
to support you either.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.900
Everyone's up!

12:04.160 --> 12:08.290
That's interesting.
A company that supports excavators?

12:08.290 --> 12:12.460
Surely you've heard of TKBM?

12:14.060 --> 12:15.880
So that's what it's about.

12:25.040 --> 12:28.230
- See you never.
- Wait!

12:30.230 --> 12:31.730
Sorry about this.

12:31.730 --> 12:36.740
If you need help,
just ask your beloved TKBM.

12:36.740 --> 12:38.280
Seal off the tomb!

12:46.290 --> 12:50.670
Shit! Someone help!

12:56.320 --> 12:59.970
Today, an earthquake occurred
in Yeongdeungpo.

13:00.530 --> 13:03.410
In addition, an unidentified structure appeared,

13:03.410 --> 13:05.150
- temporarily trapping more than 50 people.
- Calm down.

13:05.150 --> 13:06.540
- temporarily trapping more than 50 people.
- This way.

13:06.540 --> 13:07.980
- It is reported that the interior
- You're okay now.

13:07.980 --> 13:09.460
was in a dangerous condition,

13:09.460 --> 13:11.940
with knives protruding from the walls.

13:13.480 --> 13:18.080
EARTHQUAKE IN YEONGDEUNGPO
He said he was from Japan.

13:18.080 --> 13:18.990
SEOUL - YONG-IN, GYEONGGI
And then...

13:18.990 --> 13:21.400
EARTHQUAKE IN YEONGDEUNGPO,
The government is awaiting an official response

13:21.400 --> 13:23.630
EARTHQUAKE IN YEONGDEUNGPO,
from the Japanese administration.

13:23.630 --> 13:26.370
SEOUL - YONG-IN, GYEONGGI
Meanwhile, the Chinese and Russian governments

13:26.370 --> 13:27.540
SEOUL - YONG-IN, GYEONGGI
have condemned Japan,

13:27.540 --> 13:28.820
and the American...

13:31.420 --> 13:33.410
This has turned big...

13:35.650 --> 13:40.010
Now the mass media knows about
the tombs and relics! How?!

13:40.620 --> 13:44.010
Not to mention,
you made Japan look terrible!

13:44.750 --> 13:47.710
An unexpected situation arose this time.

13:47.710 --> 13:50.520
It's because of that Korean in the prophecy.

13:50.520 --> 13:54.050
Wasn't it you, Mori Hiroyuki,
the head of the excavation team,

13:54.050 --> 13:57.810
who said, "We'll take care of that
Korean agent, no problem"?!

13:59.440 --> 14:01.280
My apologies.

14:02.660 --> 14:05.030
But it's all right now.

14:05.940 --> 14:08.110
With the power of Future Guide,

14:08.110 --> 14:11.040
we can track down that guy.

14:11.040 --> 14:15.080
What? That’s something only someone the user
has met in person should be able to do, right?

14:15.580 --> 14:19.590
Because Abe, marked by the Future Guide
came into contact with him,

14:20.130 --> 14:23.550
it is now possible to mark him,
albeit imperfectly.

14:24.560 --> 14:29.040
Please give me one more chance!
I'll make it a success this time!

14:31.930 --> 14:34.940
BUSINESS HOTEL

14:38.320 --> 14:42.720
Damn it... This is the problem
with forced Dominance.

14:42.720 --> 14:47.490
It's from using Dominance to obtain
the relic instead of clearing the trial.

14:47.490 --> 14:51.040
The more powerful the relic,
the harder it resists.

14:51.040 --> 14:53.960
If I keep using this method,
my body won't last.

14:54.910 --> 14:55.920
Oh...

14:56.610 --> 14:58.940
YOU HAVE EXITED THE TOMB
Reward, huh?

14:58.940 --> 15:00.220
YOU WILL NOW BE REWARDED FOR COMPLETING
THE MISSION "ACTIVATE TOMB RAIDER'S BASIC SKILLS"

15:00.220 --> 15:01.150
BEFORE YOU RECEIVE YOUR REWARD,
Path of Domination or Path of Affinity?

15:01.150 --> 15:02.170
PLEASE CHOOSE CAREFULLY:
Path of Domination or Path of Affinity?

15:02.170 --> 15:03.470
PATH OF DOMINATION - PATH OF AFFINITY
Path of Domination or Path of Affinity?

15:04.210 --> 15:06.640
You still don't understand me yet?

15:06.640 --> 15:08.970
What a shame, really.

15:09.410 --> 15:11.470
I will choose the Path of Dominance.

15:11.470 --> 15:13.480
YOU HAVE RECEIVED YOUR MISSION REWARD

15:13.480 --> 15:15.480
All right.

15:22.140 --> 15:23.220
Huh?

15:27.300 --> 15:29.940
Hey, why aren't you giving me anything?

15:29.940 --> 15:33.280
Shouldn't there be a loot box or something?

15:39.540 --> 15:41.550
???
RANK ?/CONSUMABLE RELIC, INSTANT FOOD TYPE

15:41.550 --> 15:45.550
Looks like your average candy.
You want me to eat this?

15:47.440 --> 15:51.050
If I die after eating this,
guess that's the end of me.

15:53.200 --> 15:55.060
That's bitter!

16:00.430 --> 16:02.570
My wound is healed?

16:02.570 --> 16:04.650
YOU HAVE WITHSTOOD THE RELIC POISONING
AND HAVE MADE A FULL RECOVERY

16:04.650 --> 16:06.570
YOU HAVE DISCOVERED
THE SKILL TOLERANCE (IMMUNITY)

16:07.810 --> 16:09.260
Tolerance?

16:15.270 --> 16:17.060
Tolerance, huh...

16:18.210 --> 16:22.590
If this can protect me against relic poisoning,
it’s an outstanding skill.

16:24.800 --> 16:27.590
So this is the Crow's work too?

16:27.590 --> 16:30.590
Hey, what are you thinking, Crow?

16:31.870 --> 16:35.600
What's in it for you
to give me an advantage?

16:36.670 --> 16:38.830
Damn prick.

16:40.600 --> 16:44.110
YOU HAVE BEEN MARKED BY AN S RANK RELIC
YOUR FUTURE IS BEING READ

16:44.110 --> 16:48.050
Tsk. The Future Guide found me.

16:48.800 --> 16:51.550
FUTURE GUIDE
Princess Shotoku's Future Guide.

16:51.550 --> 16:54.160
FUTURE GUIDE
A book of prophecies said to have been written

16:54.160 --> 16:56.870
FUTURE GUIDE
by Prince Shotoku, a statesman in ancient Japan.

16:56.870 --> 17:01.380
Rather than creating a tomb,
it has chosen its owners.

17:01.380 --> 17:04.369
Sasaki Yuka was chosen to be its owner.

17:04.369 --> 17:06.380
FUTURE GUIDE

17:06.859 --> 17:11.390
It wasn't long before the Japanese government
learned of her and the Future Guide's existence.

17:11.920 --> 17:14.560
The excavation team,
wanting to use its power for themselves,

17:14.560 --> 17:17.460
spared no expense to secure
Sasaki's cooperation.

17:18.300 --> 17:21.700
Normally, it should be a happy ending...

17:25.950 --> 17:28.860
Sasaki, who was not good at studying,

17:28.860 --> 17:31.380
was unable to make
full use of the prophecy

17:31.380 --> 17:34.370
written in difficult classical Japanese.

17:34.370 --> 17:38.430
Eventually, by someone who possessed
a more powerful prophetic relic,

17:38.430 --> 17:40.000
she ended up...

17:55.350 --> 17:56.800
Sousuke!

17:56.800 --> 17:58.900
Um, Miss Sasaki?

17:58.900 --> 18:01.220
It's time to read the Future Guide.

18:01.220 --> 18:03.650
Oh, already?

18:07.140 --> 18:10.440
The text is too complicated,
I'm getting a vertigo...

18:12.070 --> 18:14.850
It's all Kanji I don't know...

18:16.270 --> 18:19.740
If you don't know the characters,
just copy them as is.

18:21.460 --> 18:23.310
What's wrong?

18:23.310 --> 18:27.960
I-It says I'm about to die!

18:27.960 --> 18:30.960
SASAKI DIES

18:37.340 --> 18:39.970
That's Japan for you.
They have authentic sushi.

18:40.860 --> 18:44.830
By the way, even though
I went all the way here by plane,

18:44.830 --> 18:47.230
when are they going to show up?

18:47.770 --> 18:48.980
SASAKI YUKA DIES

18:49.510 --> 18:52.590
The prophecy shouldn't fail to mention
the content cursing Sasaki Yuka,

18:52.590 --> 18:54.690
the owner of the relic.

18:54.690 --> 18:56.990
They should've been aware of it.

18:59.410 --> 19:01.790
What are they hesitating for?

19:07.660 --> 19:09.900
Are you ready? Calm down.

19:09.900 --> 19:12.580
He's here to kill me...

19:12.580 --> 19:16.260
No way I can bring sushi to him...

19:16.910 --> 19:19.260
Just look him in the eye and get out.

19:19.260 --> 19:22.560
That way, we can mark him fully.

19:23.270 --> 19:26.320
Besides, he doesn't know who you are.

19:26.770 --> 19:30.420
If something happens,
I'll protect you. Go for it.

19:31.570 --> 19:33.760
Excuse me.

19:33.760 --> 19:37.070
I've brought your order of sushi.

19:46.740 --> 19:48.080
There's no doubt.

19:48.910 --> 19:51.730
The Future Guide owner
is presenting herself?

19:51.730 --> 19:53.520
Now that's bold.

19:54.180 --> 19:55.590
How amusing.

19:57.590 --> 19:59.740
His hand is on the katana!

19:59.740 --> 20:01.810
Sasaki's in danger! Go in!

20:03.810 --> 20:06.700
All right, time to breach.

20:06.700 --> 20:08.400
One, two!

20:20.950 --> 20:23.760
Mister...

20:23.760 --> 20:26.430
Can I be your fan?

20:26.430 --> 20:29.960
What's going on here?

20:30.480 --> 20:32.320
I want to talk to you...

20:32.320 --> 20:34.510
Oh, I guess we can't
let anyone outside know.

20:34.510 --> 20:35.960
Hang on.

20:39.620 --> 20:40.970
Here!

20:40.970 --> 20:41.790
I FOL IN LOVE WITHCHU U TOTES HOT MR >_<
WHEW WHEW (OUT OF WORDS)

20:41.790 --> 20:43.130
WANNA BOBA TOGETHER LATER?
Totes hot?

20:43.130 --> 20:43.970
ALSO GLIS FREND IRU?

20:43.970 --> 20:45.600
TOTES HOT, FOL IN LOVE, WHEW WHEW
What is this language?

20:45.600 --> 20:46.980
BOBA TOGETHER?, GLIS FREND IRU^3^?
What's her idea here?

20:46.980 --> 20:48.050
What's her idea here?

20:48.050 --> 20:50.220
Is this really the right thing to do now?

20:52.500 --> 20:55.630
Well, it's a good opportunity for me.

21:00.770 --> 21:01.530
Here.

21:05.150 --> 21:08.660
We don't know what's going on inside at all.

21:08.660 --> 21:10.180
Check the cameras...

21:17.920 --> 21:19.670
Let's go now.

21:19.670 --> 21:21.850
Now that we've gotten rid
of the troublemakers,

21:21.850 --> 21:25.990
why don't we go on a date
somewhere with a nice atmosphere?

23:03.540 --> 23:05.950
What are you doing, gosh?!

23:05.950 --> 23:08.180
Sasaki's getting taken away!

23:08.180 --> 23:11.120
It was quite a large-scale operation,

23:11.120 --> 23:13.020
but it was just too half-baked.

23:13.020 --> 23:16.460
Damn you! This is the only time
you get to be cocky!

23:16.460 --> 23:19.980
We'll show you what
the Japanese government is made of!

23:19.980 --> 23:21.920
Can't wait for that.

23:21.920 --> 23:24.470
Now that I've confirmed
the prophecy in the Future Guide,

23:24.470 --> 23:26.720
I'm going for the next relic.

23:26.720 --> 23:27.970
Say what?!

23:27.970 --> 23:30.990
Where are you going while ignoring us?!

23:30.990 --> 23:33.820
Next time, "The One Who Stole the Future."

23:33.820 --> 23:36.310
Now, the relic I'm looking for

23:36.310 --> 23:38.380
EPISODE 4: THE ONE WHO STOLE THE FUTURE
is in the auction in Las Vegas.

23:38.380 --> 23:41.380
EPISODE 4: THE ONE WHO STOLE THE FUTURE
